{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"dreary-indisposed-morayeel","creation_channel":"cli","description":"Discovered while prepping 2948. The durable gate-error record hashes tool args and drops results, so a runaway abort tells us the SHAPE (196 tool_calls, 164 distinct, search_files-dominated) but not the WHY. Added docs/experiments/diag_runaway_transcript.py (opt-in, local-only transcript capture; raw results never committed) and drove the real verify_completion against f6fc.\n\nMEASURED FINDINGS (see docs/experiments/diag-runaway-transcript.md):\n1. Same f6fc tree that ran away at the 480-step floor (196 calls) CONVERGED and PASSED at a 50-step floor (98 calls). Budget-anchored expansion: the verification appears to expand to fill the request budget it is given.\n2. Dominant waste is RE-READING: 48 read_file calls hit only 11 distinct files (37 re-reads, 77%). Different line ranges give different signatures, so the f6fc exact-signature memo does NOT collapse them.\n3. NOT a tight loop and NOT tool false-negatives: 0 tool errors; all (no matches) were correct path-scoped misses. Minor tax: occasional regex queries against the substring-only search_files and line-number literals.\n\nIMPLICATIONS: validates 2948's banking thesis with real data; surfaces two NEW levers not in 2948's plan — (a) the flat _VERIFY_MIN_STEPS=480 floor may itself induce wandering (try criteria-scaled floor), (b) normalize read_file memo signatures by path to collapse the 77% re-read tax.\n\nACCEPTANCE: findings recorded durably (this ticket + docs/experiments artifact); decision recorded on whether to fold the two new levers into 2948 or split them out.","id":"d2df-936d-718a-4fcd","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Instrument + diagnose completion-verifier runaway: measured root cause"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1786065659390661001,"uuid":"1ee74f72-0c16-4e83-8a4a-eb5fcaafd442"}